IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cema-types`
IMPORT `cema-forfeiture`
IMPORT `cema-penalties`
IMPORT `cema-time-limits`
IMPORT `cema-goal`

-- Customs and Excise Management Act 1979 (UK) — the encoder's tests.
-- Expected values are worked by hand from the Act.

§ `Tests`

-- Fields: seized, present, owner known, notice served, claim given, para 4.
GIVEN notice IS A MAYBE DATE, claim IS A MAYBE DATE, ok IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Seizure facts`
`seized 31 January 2026, notice` notice `, claim` claim `, para 4` ok MEANS
    `Seizure facts` OF Date 31 1 2026, FALSE, TRUE, notice, claim, ok

§§ `Goal 1 — seizure and condemnation`

#ASSERT `notice of seizure must be given for` (`seized 31 January 2026, notice` NOTHING `, claim` NOTHING `, para 4` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`notice of seizure must be given for` (`Seizure facts` OF Date 31 1 2026, TRUE, TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING, TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`notice of seizure must be given for` (`Seizure facts` OF Date 31 1 2026, FALSE, FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING, TRUE))
-- No notice: one month from 31 January 2026 is 28 February 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day for a notice of claim for` (`seized 31 January 2026, notice` NOTHING `, claim` NOTHING `, para 4` TRUE) EQUALS Date 28 2 2026
-- Notice served 10 February 2026: 10 March 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day for a notice of claim for` (`seized 31 January 2026, notice` (JUST (Date 10 2 2026)) `, claim` NOTHING `, para 4` TRUE) EQUALS Date 10 3 2026
#ASSERT `the condemnation outcome for` (`seized 31 January 2026, notice` (JUST (Date 10 2 2026)) `, claim` (JUST (Date 10 3 2026)) `, para 4` TRUE) EQUALS `the Commissioners must take condemnation proceedings`
#ASSERT `the condemnation outcome for` (`seized 31 January 2026, notice` (JUST (Date 10 2 2026)) `, claim` (JUST (Date 11 3 2026)) `, para 4` TRUE) EQUALS `deemed condemned as forfeited`
#ASSERT `the condemnation outcome for` (`seized 31 January 2026, notice` (JUST (Date 10 2 2026)) `, claim` (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) `, para 4` FALSE) EQUALS `deemed condemned as forfeited`
#ASSERT `the condemnation outcome for` (`seized 31 January 2026, notice` NOTHING `, claim` NOTHING `, para 4` TRUE) EQUALS `deemed condemned as forfeited`

§§ `Goal 2 — penalties`

-- Fields: kind, value, acquired/dealt, intent, concerned, corresponding,
-- fixed sum.
GIVEN k IS A `Kind of goods`, v IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `Evasion facts`
`evasion of` k `worth` v MEANS
    `Evasion facts` OF k, v, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, 20000

#ASSERT `an offence under s 170 is made out by` (`evasion of` `ordinary goods` `worth` 1000)
#ASSERT `an offence under s 170 is made out by` (`Evasion facts` OF `ordinary goods`, 1000, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 20000)
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under s 170 is made out by` (`Evasion facts` OF `ordinary goods`, 1000, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 20000))
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under s 170 is made out by` (`Evasion facts` OF `ordinary goods`, 1000, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 20000))

p1 MEANS `the maximum penalties under s 170 for` (`evasion of` `ordinary goods` `worth` 1000)
#ASSERT p1's `summary penalty` EQUALS 20000
#ASSERT p1's `summary imprisonment, months` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT p1's `penalty on indictment` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT p1's `imprisonment on indictment` EQUALS `imprisonment for months` 168
p2 MEANS `the maximum penalties under s 170 for` (`evasion of` `ordinary goods` `worth` 10000)
#ASSERT p2's `summary penalty` EQUALS 30000
p3 MEANS `the maximum penalties under s 170 for` (`evasion of` `a Class A drug` `worth` 10000)
#ASSERT p3's `imprisonment on indictment` EQUALS `imprisonment for life`
p4 MEANS `the maximum penalties under s 170 for` (`evasion of` `a Class C drug` `worth` 100)
#ASSERT p4's `summary penalty` EQUALS 500
#ASSERT p4's `summary imprisonment, months` EQUALS 3
p5 MEANS `the maximum penalties under s 170 for` (`evasion of` `a Class C drug` `worth` 1000)
#ASSERT p5's `summary penalty` EQUALS 3000
p6 MEANS `the maximum penalties under s 170 for` (`evasion of` `seal skins` `worth` 50000)
#ASSERT p6's `summary penalty` EQUALS 20000
#ASSERT p6's `imprisonment on indictment` EQUALS `imprisonment for months` 24
p7 MEANS `the maximum penalties under s 170 for` (`evasion of` `a prohibited weapon within s 170(4A)` `worth` 100)
#ASSERT p7's `imprisonment on indictment` EQUALS `imprisonment for life`
p8 MEANS `the maximum penalties under s 170 for` (`evasion of` `a Class B drug or temporary class drug` `worth` 100)
#ASSERT p8's `imprisonment on indictment` EQUALS `imprisonment for months` 168
#ASSERT `the maximum aggregate imprisonment on summary conviction and default, months` EQUALS 15

§§ `Goal 3 — time limits`

-- Indictable, committed 15 May 2010: 14 May 2030.
#ASSERT `the last day to commence proceedings for` (`Offence timing` OF Date 15 5 2010, TRUE, Date 1 1 2025) EQUALS Date 14 5 2030
-- Summary, committed 10 January 2024: three years end 9 January 2027;
-- evidence on 1 March 2024 gives 1 September 2024.
#ASSERT `the last day to commence proceedings for` (`Offence timing` OF Date 10 1 2024, FALSE, Date 1 3 2024) EQUALS Date 1 9 2024
-- Evidence on 1 October 2026: 1 April 2027 is after 9 January 2027.
#ASSERT `the last day to commence proceedings for` (`Offence timing` OF Date 10 1 2024, FALSE, Date 1 10 2026) EQUALS Date 9 1 2027
-- Committed 29 February 2024: three years end 28 February 2027.
#ASSERT `the last day to commence proceedings for` (`Offence timing` OF Date 29 2 2024, FALSE, Date 1 12 2026) EQUALS Date 28 2 2027

§§ `The top-level goal`

pos MEANS `the customs position for` (`Customs case` OF JUST (`seized 31 January 2026, notice` NOTHING `, claim` (JUST (Date 27 2 2026)) `, para 4` TRUE), JUST (`evasion of` `ordinary goods` `worth` 10000), JUST (`Offence timing` OF Date 31 1 2026, TRUE, Date 31 1 2026))
#ASSERT pos's `notice of seizure required` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT pos's `last day for a notice of claim` EQUALS JUST (Date 28 2 2026)
#ASSERT pos's `condemnation outcome` EQUALS JUST `the Commissioners must take condemnation proceedings`
#ASSERT pos's `offence under s 170` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT pos's `last day to commence proceedings` EQUALS JUST (Date 30 1 2046)
